## EmailJS credentials for sending candidate invite emails (https://www.emailjs.com/).
## Create a service + template there, then copy the three IDs below into a local .env file.
## Template variables used: to_email, to_name, drive_name, test_link.
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=
